# --- solutions ---
# `.course/solutions/` is a git SUBMODULE (see AGENTS.md). Do not add ignore
# rules for paths inside it - the parent repo cannot ignore a submodule's
# contents, and .course/solutions/.gitignore handles them instead.

# --- data too large to track ---
# The 3.3 GB challenge dataset is distributed via polybox and placed here by the
# student; see book/setup/download_data.md. Everything else in data/ IS tracked,
# as plain blobs. (The per-well summary counts are instructor material, in
# .course/solutions/challenge/.)
data/challenge/plate01.nd2
data/challenge/plate01.zip
data/_cache/

# Ignore secrets in '.env'
.env
